{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33986","headline":"送李明府之任海南 · 皮日休","name":"送李明府之任海南","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五羊城在蜃楼边，墨绶垂腰正少年。\n山静不应闻屈鸟，草深从使翳贪泉。\n蟹奴晴上临潮槛，燕婢秋随过海船。\n一事与君消远宦，乳蕉花发讼庭前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33986.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33986","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}